1
00:00:00,382 --> 00:00:01,952
(Sheldon:)I've been racking
my brain for days,

2
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:04,920
(Sheldon:)and I've got nothing.

3
00:00:05,988 --> 00:00:07,018
(Leonard:)Seriously?

4
00:00:07,022 --> 00:00:08,622
(Sheldon:)I can't do it.

5
00:00:08,624 --> 00:00:10,724
(Sheldon:)I'm not as smart
as I think I am.

6
00:00:10,726 --> 00:00:14,266
(Sheldon:)I'm so sorry.
This is all my fault.

7
00:00:17,833 --> 00:00:19,733
(Leonard:)It's okay, we'll
figure something out.

8
00:00:19,735 --> 00:00:22,535
(Sheldon:)But what if we can't?

9
00:00:22,538 --> 00:00:25,908
(Leonard:)It'll be fine.
You'll see.

10
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:33,250
(Leonard:)Sheldon?

11
00:00:35,183 --> 00:00:37,953
(Leonard:)Buddy?

12
00:00:42,991 --> 00:00:44,421
(Howard:)When the baby gets here,

13
00:00:44,426 --> 00:00:47,056
(Howard:)you gotta teach me that.

14
00:00:50,165 --> 00:00:52,835
(Amy:)Thank you so much, Bert.
This was great.

15
00:00:52,834 --> 00:00:54,134
(Bert:)My pleasure.

16
00:00:54,136 --> 00:00:55,336
(Bert:)You girls want
to take home

17
00:00:55,337 --> 00:00:59,027
(Bert:)a two-gallon tub
of potato salad?

